WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.080
- Over a decade ago,

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:04.110
our next guest spent some time
singing alongside her family

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.070
in Central Park.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.140
Then she was discovered by Jay-Z.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.250
Never heard of him.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.830
She's gone on to become a
Grammy-winning songwriter

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.390
and critically acclaimed singer.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.490
Now performing, "I Don't Have to Pretend"

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.320
off her latest album, "Glory Hour,"

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.616
Give it up for Victory, everybody.

00:00:18.616 --> 00:00:21.575
(audience cheering)
